  "description": "\u201cTo bisect a given rectilineal angle.\u201d\n\u2014 Euclid's Elements, BOOK I \u2022 PROP. 9 (G.31)\n\n00:00 1 \u00b7 GIVEN: angle BAC\n00:03 2 \u00b7 GOAL: bisector AF of angle BAC\n00:07 3 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: point D on AB and AE = AD on AC\n00:14 4 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: segment DE\n00:18 5 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: equilateral triangle DEF\n00:22 6 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: segment AF\n00:27 7 \u00b7 ASSERT: three pairs of equal sides in DAF and EAF\n00:38 8 \u00b7 \u2234: angle DAF = angle EAF\n\nGEOMETOR \u2022 G.31 \u2022 v2",
